{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act36side_level_act36side_02_beg",
  "groupId": "act36side",
  "stageId": "act36side_02",
  "title": "Jungle Detox Stew",
  "storyCode": "DT-2",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act36side/level_act36side_02_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "e67fbcbe0010d256d0386e0a48667815ea072d6e1bb8203f26fba184db243d58",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "text": "Hurry up, Laios.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "text": "Look at this mushroom! Even the dungeon's walking mushrooms don't grow this big!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "text": "Wouldn't it be amazing to see a walking mushroom this size...? Thoughts on having it for lunch later?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "text": "Careful now. The Gourmet Guide says jungle mushrooms are basically all poisonous to some extent.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "text": "For example, they might give you full body rashes, thicken your blood, or make you throw up nonstop until every organ is down on the floor...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "text": "...I'd rather not think about what the guide's author must have been through to learn all that in such detail.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senshi",
      "text": "The orcs only taught me how to identify <i>dungeon</i> mushrooms, so we'd best leave these alone.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "text": "But there are some animals that eat them!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senshi",
      "text": "Still no. If only one or two critters consider it edible, it means it's probably toxic to everything else.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senshi",
      "text": "In other words, if we see lots of animals eating this, then it's likely to be edible for us, too.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "text": "Right...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "(Low roar)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "text": "What was that?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "(Piercing buzzing)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "text": "There's something flying towards us! Careful, everyone!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios's Party",
      "text": "WAAAAAAHHHH!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "text": "(Knocks here and there)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "text": "Ha! Now that was an impressive explosion!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "text": "A good thing the test site was empty.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "text": "Let me see...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "text": "Chamber pressure, off the charts. Same goes for temperature readings, and load capacity too!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "text": "Seems like it'll need reinforcement to perform well.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "text": "Next, final adjustments to the previous configuration, loosen the belt, tighten the screws, and... done!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "text": "My newest masterpiece, the 'Invincible Cool Thing' will be fully operational. As long as I don't run into another accident!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "text": "Oh, I should get rid of all these explosives first.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "text": "Safety first! Avoid open flames...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "text": "(Knocks here and there)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "text": "*cough* *cough* That thing over there keeps blowing up...!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "text": "*cough* *cough*...!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "text": "You alright, Marcille?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "text": "I-I'm fine! Just a little dizzy...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "(Low roar)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "text": "There's more...! Careful!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "text": "A golem? Maybe a gargoyle?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "text": "Taste my magic—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "BOOM—!!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "High Priest, High Priest? You there?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "...What was that?\n—Wagh!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "text": "A crocodile?! Or a beast-man with a crocodile head?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gator-headed Beast-man",
      "text": "Huh? What's a beast-man?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "text": "He can speak too!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gator-headed Beast-man",
      "text": "Why wouldn't I be able to? Hey, you there, Durins, did you crawl up from the underground?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senshi",
      "text": "'Durins'?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "text": "Is he talking about us?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gator-headed Beast-man",
      "text": "See any other short ones around here?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senshi",
      "text": "Are you saying me and Chilchuck look like the same race to you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "text": "Don't you guys have 'Half-foot' here?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gator-headed Beast-man",
      "text": "...What are you talking about? Is something wrong with you all?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gator-headed Beast-man",
      "text": "Right, have you seen our High Priest here?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "text": "High Priest?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gator-headed Beast-man",
      "text": "Old guy, shorter than me, wears glasses.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "text": "What's he doing in such a dangerous place?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gator-headed Beast-man",
      "text": "Dunno. He thinks in mysterious ways.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "text": "Well, we haven't run into any old men.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gator-headed Beast-man",
      "text": "He also moves in mysterious ways.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gator-headed Beast-man",
      "text": "Guess I should just give up and get back to the tribe, then. Like all the times I went out and looked for him before.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gator-headed Beast-man",
      "text": "Goodbye, strange tourists!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "text": "Wait! Could I ask if you've heard of Rhodes Island?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gator-headed Beast-man",
      "text": "Heh. Lucky for you, but also unlucky. Because I feel like I have, but also not.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gator-headed Beast-man",
      "text": "There's someone else in the tribe who I'm sure knows where this Whatever Island is though.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gator-headed Beast-man",
      "text": "But that person happens to be...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "text": "That High Priest you're looking for?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gator-headed Beast-man",
      "text": "Bingo.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gator-headed Beast-man",
      "text": "How's this? Come back with me. We hardly ever find him when we go looking, but he always comes back sooner or later.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bright Gator-headed Beast-man",
      "text": "So basically, you guys were on an island with a huge dungeon, and somehow ended up here?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "text": "More or less. Do you know anything about it?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bright Gator-headed Beast-man",
      "text": "Uh... What's an island?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "text": "Huh? It's... a landmass completely surrounded by sea.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bright Gator-headed Beast-man",
      "text": "What's a sea?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "text": "Um... a large body of water?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bright Gator-headed Beast-man",
      "text": "You mean a lake? You really like to use strange words.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "text": "Well, is it because we're inland right now and you haven't heard of...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bright Gator-headed Beast-man",
      "text": "It's because your questions are so strange! I've never heard of a sea, an island, or a Merini Village. Were you swept here from the other side of Terra by someone's tail or something?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "text": "'Terra'?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bright Gator-headed Beast-man",
      "text": "It's what we're standing on right now.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Marcille tries to read the crocodile man's face for any sign he was pranking her.\nUnfortunately, the only message she gets from his eyes is 'Am I talking to a fool?'"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "text": "So in short, the one who calls the shots in this tribe of crocodiles—er, Archosauria—is the High Priest. The one Marcille blew up earlier was his...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria A",
      "text": "His mech.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria B",
      "text": "The 'Invincible Cool Thing.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "text": "But if we blew up his 'mech'... would he still be willing to help us find Rhodes Island?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria A",
      "text": "It's fine. It would've exploded with or without you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria B",
      "text": "Always manages to blow up somehow.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bright Archosauria",
      "text": "The High Priest is a friendly man. I'm sure he won't blame you if you just explain everything.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bright Archosauria",
      "text": "He's also a righteous man. He wouldn't leave a group of lost visitors stranded.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bright Archosauria",
      "text": "That's our High Priest!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "text": "Still, we should come up with a way to make amends.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bright Archosauria",
      "text": "Don't worry about it—wait, what's that good smell? Who's cooking today?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria Warrior",
      "text": "The Durin with the huge beard.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "text": "Terra, Acahualla, living paintings, the dungeon...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "text": "Ugh... I can't wrap my head around it all.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "text": "I can use magic here, so at the very least some of the laws of reality are shared...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "text": "Falin... I bet I'd be as excited as Laios if you were here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "text": "*sigh* I miss our days back at the academy.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "text": "Back then...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "text": "Wait, the berries that those little birds are eating...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "text": "They look like that fruit Falin offered me back then...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria A",
      "text": "Smells great. Are Durins good at cooking too?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senshi",
      "text": "For the last time, I'm not a Durin... *sigh* Never mind, suit yourself.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria A",
      "text": "Quick, round everyone up to try out this bearded Durin's cooking!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria B",
      "text": "Right, you guys were looking for the High Priest?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "text": "Yeah. We want to ask him some questions.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria A",
      "text": "It's true he knows much, but it's hard to meet him. It's easy if he wants to see you; but impossible if he doesn't.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "text": "Sounds like your classic sage type... So how do we get him to want to see us?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria B",
      "text": "Hmm... Zumama said that if we wanted the High Priest to share his wisdom, we should make some noise to attract him!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senshi",
      "text": "Noise... would a big feast count?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria B",
      "text": "Yeah. Something like that.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "text": "No objections here. Let's ask Marcille what she thinks.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "text": "Speaking of which, where is she?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "text": "She hasn't returned yet?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "text": "Damn you, Red Dragon! GIVE FALIN BACK TO ME!!!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
